  "definition_ja": "n 番目の、また n 次・n 回目の。第 n 項（the nth term）、n 乗根（the nth root）、第 n 次導関数（the nth derivative）のように使う。",
  "definition_en": "The ordinal of n: in position n (the nth term), or of order n (the nth root, the nth derivative).",
  "latex": null,
  "spoken_en": null,
  "examples": [
