      "en": "What's the nth term? Just replace 5 with n.",
      "ja": "n 番目の項は？ 5 を n に置き換えるだけ。",
      "register": "spoken"
    },
    {
      "en": "Find the nth term of the sequence 1, 4, 9, 16, ….",
      "ja": "数列 1, 4, 9, 16, … の第 n 項を求めよ。",
